    -- App.Preview.Config's hidden-window policy, and
    -- App.ResourceRoot's root precedence (#1949). All live in the
    -- executable rather than the library, and their app-local imports
    -- stay within this set, so compiling them into this suite tests
    -- their policy without booting a process. `test-headless` stays
